stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_build_tx_env: tx_env = TransactionEnvironment(origin=SYSTEM_ADDRESS, gas=SYSTEM_TRANSACTION_GAS, ...)
    q_build_tx_env --> q_build_msg: system_tx_message = Message(caller=SYSTEM_ADDRESS, target=target_address, code=system_contract_code, ...)
    q_build_msg --> q_process: system_tx_output = process_message_call(system_tx_message)
    q_process --> [*]: return system_tx_output
    note right of q_process
        INV-001: System transactions always originate from SYSTEM_ADDRESS (0xff...fe)
        INV-002: Gas is fixed at SYSTEM_TRANSACTION_GAS (30,000,000)
        INV-003: should_transfer_value is False
        INV-004: No value is transferred (value = 0)
